      "text": "\n\n0x800: GDT Pointer (6 bytes)\n   - 2 bytes for size (limit)\n   - 4 bytes for address of first entry\n\n0x806: Null descriptor (8 bytes)\n   - All zeros (required by CPU)\n\n0x80E: Kernel Code (8 bytes)\n   - base=0, limit=0xFFFFFFFF\n   - access=0x9A (Ring 0, Code, Readable, Present)\n   - flags=0xCF (4KB granularity, 32-bit protected mode)\n\n0x816: Kernel Data (8 bytes)\n   - base=0, limit=0xFFFFFFFF\n   - access=0x92 (Ring 0, Data, Writable, Present)\n   - flags=0xCF (4KB granularity, 32-bit protected mode)\n\n0x81E: Kernel Stack (8 bytes)\n   - base=0, limit=0xFFFFFFFF\n   - access=0x92 (Ring 0, Data, Writable, Present)\n   - flags=0xCF (4KB granularity, 32-bit protected mode)\n\n0x826: User Code (8 bytes)\n   - base=0, limit=0xFFFFFFFF\n   - access=0xFA (Ring 3, Code, Readable, Present)\n   - flags=0xCF (4KB granularity, 32-bit protected mode)\n\n0x82E: User Data (8 bytes)\n   - base=0, limit=0xFFFFFFFF\n   - access=0xF2 (Ring 3, Data, Writable, Present)\n   - flags=0xCF (4KB granularity, 32-bit protected mode)\n\nneeded by subject, but will be deleted after:\n0x836: User Stack (8 bytes)\n   - base=0, limit=0xFFFFFFFF\n   - access=0xF2 (Ring 3, Data, Writable, Present)\n   - flags=0xCF (4KB granularity, 32-bit protected mode)",
      "fontSize": 20.3248730964467,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Mx7xLXTVgLHPijw-oAh16",
      "originalText": "\n\n0x800: GDT Pointer (6 bytes)\n   - 2 bytes for size (limit)\n   - 4 bytes for address of first entry\n\n0x806: Null descriptor (8 bytes)\n   - All zeros (required by CPU)\n\n0x80E: Kernel Code (8 bytes)\n   - base=0, limit=0xFFFFFFFF\n   - access=0x9A (Ring 0, Code, Readable, Present)\n   - flags=0xCF (4KB granularity, 32-bit protected mode)\n\n0x816: Kernel Data (8 bytes)\n   - base=0, limit=0xFFFFFFFF\n   - access=0x92 (Ring 0, Data, Writable, Present)\n   - flags=0xCF (4KB granularity, 32-bit protected mode)\n\n0x81E: Kernel Stack (8 bytes)\n   - base=0, limit=0xFFFFFFFF\n   - access=0x92 (Ring 0, Data, Writable, Present)\n   - flags=0xCF (4KB granularity, 32-bit protected mode)\n\n0x826: User Code (8 bytes)\n   - base=0, limit=0xFFFFFFFF\n   - access=0xFA (Ring 3, Code, Readable, Present)\n   - flags=0xCF (4KB granularity, 32-bit protected mode)\n\n0x82E: User Data (8 bytes)\n   - base=0, limit=0xFFFFFFFF\n   - access=0xF2 (Ring 3, Data, Writable, Present)\n   - flags=0xCF (4KB granularity, 32-bit protected mode)\n\nneeded by subject, but will be deleted after:\n0x836: User Stack (8 bytes)\n   - base=0, limit=0xFFFFFFFF\n   - access=0xF2 (Ring 3, Data, Writable, Present)\n   - flags=0xCF (4KB granularity, 32-bit protected mode)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
